---
interface Props { level?: 'h1' | 'h2'; withImage?: boolean }
const { level = 'h2', withImage = true } = Astro.props;
const H = level;
---
<section class="section s-paper" id="about" data-section="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__grid">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker reveal">About RDL Sony</span>
        <H class="about__quote reveal">Genuine Sony, <em>priced to beat</em> anyone in Bangalore.</H>
        <div class="about__copy reveal">
          <p>RDL Sony, HSR Layout has been a trusted Sony electronics retailer in Bangalore, offering an extensive range of products from 32-inch TVs to impressive 98-inch displays along with superior audio systems.</p>
          <p>Known for competitive pricing and exceptional customer service, the store is about one thing: making cutting-edge Sony technology accessible and enjoyable for every household in the city.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="points">
        <li class="reveal"><span class="num">01</span><div><h3>Authentic products</h3><p>We stock only genuine Sony electronics, ensuring quality and reliability.</p></div></li>
        <li class="reveal"><span class="num">02</span><div><h3>Best prices</h3><p>Our pricing beats competitors across Bangalore for all TV sizes and audio systems.</p></div></li>
        <li class="reveal"><span class="num">03</span><div><h3>Variety</h3><p>Sony TVs from 32″ to 98″, and premium headphones and home audio.</p></div></li>
        <li class="reveal"><span class="num">04</span><div><h3>Mission, vision, values</h3><p>Best-priced authentic Sony with excellent service; to be Bangalore’s trusted leader for Sony TVs and audio. Authenticity, affordability, customer satisfaction, innovation, integrity.</p></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    {withImage && (
      <div class="about__media reveal">
        <img src="/images/banners/living-room-tv.webp" alt="A Sony BRAVIA television in a living room" loading="lazy" class="parallax-img" data-speed="0.12" />
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</section>
